carousel__content\\\">\\n            <span class=\\\"fisica-home-carousel__label\\\">Vida acad\\u00eamica<\\/span>\\n            <h3>Instituto de F\\u00edsica celebra formatura da turma de 2025\\/2<\\/h3>\\n            <p>Depois de v\\u00e1rios anos, o Instituto de F\\u00edsica da UERJ voltou a realizar uma festa de formatura de Licenciatura e Bacharelado, celebrando a conclus\\u00e3o de 20 estudantes da turma de 2025\\/2.<\\/p>\\n          <\\/div>\\n        <\\/a>\\n        <\\/div>\\n      <div class=\\\"fisica-home-carousel__controls\\\">\\n        <button class=\\\"fisica-home-carousel__button\\\" type=\\\"button\\\" data-carousel-prev aria-label=\\\"Slide anterior\\\">&#10094;<\\/button>\\n        <div class=\\\"fisica-home-carousel__dots\\\" data-carousel-dots><\\/div>\\n        <button class=\\\"fisica-home-carousel__button\\\" type=\\\"button\\\" data-carousel-next aria-label=\\\"Pr&oacute;ximo slide\\\">&#10095;<\\/button>\\n      <\\/div>\\n    <\\/div>\\n  <\\/div>\\n<\\/section>\\n\\n<script>\\n(() => {\\n  const root = document.querySelector(\'[data-carousel]\');\\n  if (!root || root.dataset.ready === \'true\') {\\n    return;\\n  }\\n  root.dataset.ready = \'true\';\\n\\n  const track = root.querySelector(\'.fisica-home-carousel__track\');\\n  const slides = Array.from(root.querySelectorAll(\'.fisica-home-carousel__slide\'));\\n  const next = root.querySelector(\'[data-carousel-next]\');\\n  const prev = root.querySelector(\'[data-carousel-prev]\');\\n  const dotsWrap = root.querySelector(\'[data-carousel-dots]\');\\n\\n  if (!track || !slides.length || !next || !prev || !dotsWrap) {\\n    return;\\n  }\\n\\n  let index = 0;\\n  let timer = null;\\n\\n  const dots = slides.map((_, i) => {\\n    const dot = document.createElement(\'button\');\\n    dot.type = \'button\';\\n    dot.className = \'fisica-home-carousel__dot\';\\n    dot.setAttribute(\'aria-label\', `Ir para slide ${i + 1}`);\\n    dot.addEventListener(\'click\', () => {\\n      goTo(i);\\n      restart();\\n    });\\n    dotsWrap.appendChild(dot);\\n    return dot;\\n  });\\n\\n  function render() {\\n    track.style.transform = `translateX(-${index * 100}%)`;\\n    dots.forEach((dot, dotIndex) => {\\n      dot.classList.toggle(\'is-active\', dotIndex === index);\\n    });\\n  }\\n\\n  function goTo(nextIndex) {\\n    index = (nextIndex + slides.length) % slides.length;\\n    render();\\n  }\\n\\n  function restart() {\\n    window.clearInterval(timer);\\n    timer = window.setInterval(() => goTo(index + 1), 5500);\\n  }\\n\\n  next.addEventListener(\'click\', () => {\\n    goTo(index + 1);\\n    restart();\\n  });\\n\\n  prev.addEventListener(\'click\', () => {\\n    goTo(index - 1);\\n    restart();\\n  });\\n\\n  render();\\n  restart();\\n})();\\n<\\/script>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"html\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"homeevents1\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"flex_direction\":\"column\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"eventhtml1\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"html\":\"<section class=\\\"fisica-home-section\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"fisica-home-section__head\\\">\\n    <div>\\n      <span class=\\\"fisica-home-section__eyebrow\\\">Eventos e Destaques<\\/span>\\n      <!--<h2>Acontece no instituto<\\/h2>-->\\n      <!--<p>Um bloco mais organizado para divulgar atividades, imagens e acontecimentos relevantes da comunidade acad\\u00eamica.<\\/p>-->\\n    <\\/div>\\n  <\\/div>\\n\\n  <div class=\\\"fisica-events-grid\\\">\\n    <a class=\\\"fisica-events-card\\\" href=\\\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/fisica\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/09\\/WhatsApp-Image-2025-08-25-at-15.23.48.jpg\\\" style=\\\"background-image:url(\'http:\\/\\/localhost\\/fisica\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/09\\/WhatsApp-Image-2025-08-25-at-15.23.48.jpg\');\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"fisica-events-card__content\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"fisica-events-card__tag\\\">Galeria<\\/span>\\n        <h3>Registro visual das atividades mais recentes<\\/h3>\\n        <p>Imagens em destaque para comunicar melhor a vida acad\\u00eamica, os projetos e os eventos do instituto.<\\/p>\\n      <\\/div>\\n    <\\/a>\\n    <a class=\\\"fisica-events-card\\\" href=\\\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/fisica\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/09\\/WhatsApp-Image-2025-08-25-at-15.22.50.jpg\\\" style=\\\"background-image:url(\'http:\\/\\/localhost\\/fisica\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/09\\/WhatsApp-Image-2025-08-25-at-15.22.50.jpg\');\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"fisica-events-card__content\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"fisica-events-card__tag\\\">Comunidade<\\/span>\\n        <h3>Projetos, encontros e circula\\u00e7\\u00e3o de conhecimento<\\/h3>\\n        <p>Uma apresenta\\u00e7\\u00e3o visual mais forte para valorizar atividades de ensino, pesquisa, extens\\u00e3o e integra\\u00e7\\u00e3o institucional.<\\/p>\\n      <\\/div>\\n    <\\/a>\\n        <a class=\\\"fisica-events-card\\\" href=\\\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/fisica\\/index.php\\/rpc-2026-na-uerj-abre-inscricoes-e-submissao-de-resumos\\/\\\" style=\\\"background-image:url(\'http:\\/\\/localhost\\/fisica\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/05\\/Captura-de-tela-2026-05-14-152836.png\');\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"fisica-events-card__content\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"fisica-events-card__tag\\\">Evento internacional<\\/span>\\n        <h3>RPC 2026 na UERJ abre inscri\\u00e7\\u00f5es e submiss\\u00e3o de resumos<\\/h3>\\n        <p>UERJ sediar\\u00e1 pela primeira vez no Brasil e na Am\\u00e9rica do Sul a International Conference on Resistive Plate Chambers and Related Detectors (RPC 2026), reunindo pesquisadores e especialistas de diversos pa\\u00edses.<\\/p>\\n      <\\/div>\\n    <\\/a>\\n  <\\/div>\\n<\\/section>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"html\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"labsanchor1\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"flex_direction\":\"column\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"labshtml1\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"html\":\"<div id=\\\"laboratorios\\\"><\\/div>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"html\"},{\"id\":\"labsshort1\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"shortcode\":\"[icones_servicos_uerj]\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"shortcode\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"programanchor1\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"flex_direction\":\"column\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"programhtml1\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"html\":\"<div id=\\\"programas\\\"><\\/div>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"html\"},{\"id\":\"programshort1\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"shortcode\":\"[quadrados_servicos_link]\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"shortcode\"}],\"isInner\":false}]'),(6684,1122,'_elementor_edit_mode','builder'),(6699,1123,'_elementor_edit_mode','builder'),(6700,1123,'_elementor_template_type','wp-page'),(6701,1123,'_elementor_version','3.32.1'),(6702,1123,'_wp_page_template','elementor_header_footer'),(6703,1123,'_elementor_data','[{\"id\":\"fisicadocenteshtmlv2\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"fisicadocenteshtmlwidgetv2\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"widgetType\":\"html\",\"settings\":{\"html\":\"<section class=\\\"fisica-docentes-page\\\" data-docentes-app>\\n  <style>\\n    .fisica-docentes-page {\\n      --fisica-doc-bg: #f5f8fc;\\n      --fisica-doc-card: #ffffff;\\n      --fisica-doc-card-soft: #edf5ff;\\n      --fisica-doc-text: #16324f;\\n      --fisica-doc-text-soft: #557089;\\n      --fisica-doc-primary: #0f4c81;\\n      --fisica-doc-primary-strong: #0b2f4a;\\n      --fisica-doc-accent: #59a8ff;\\n      --fisica-doc-border: rgba(15, 76, 129, 0.14);\\n      --fisica-doc-shadow: 0 24px 56px rgba(11, 47, 74, 0.12);\\n      --fisica-doc-shadow-soft: 0 14px 30px rgba(11, 47, 74, 0.08);\\n      max-width: 1400px;\\n      margin: 0 auto;\\n      padding: 28px 18px 70px;\\n      color: var(--fisica-doc-text);\\n      font-family: \\\"Segoe UI\\\", \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial, sans-serif;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-page * {\\n      box-sizing: border-box;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-hero {\\n      position: relative;\\n      overflow: hidden;\\n      margin-bottom: 26px;\\n      padding: clamp(28px, 5vw, 42px);\\n      border-radius: 30px;\\n      background:\\n        radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(89, 168, 255, 0.32), transparent 28%),\\n        linear-gradient(135deg, #0b2f4a 0%, #0f4c81 58%, #1f6fb4 100%);\\n      box-shadow: 0 26px 58px rgba(11, 47, 74, 0.22);\\n      color: #ffffff;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-hero::after {\\n      content: \\\"\\\";\\n      position: absolute;\\n      inset: auto -70px -90px auto;\\n      width: 260px;\\n      height: 260px;\\n      border-radius: 50%;\\n      background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0));\\n      pointer-events: none;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-eyebrow {\\n      display: inline-flex;\\n      align-items: center;\\n      gap: 8px;\\n      padding: 8px 14px;\\n      border-radius: 999px;\\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);\\n      font-size: 12px;\\n      font-weight: 800;\\n      letter-spacing: 0.12em;\\n      text-transform: uppercase;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-hero h1 {\\n      margin: 16px 0 12px;\\n      max-width: 14ch;\\n      font-size: clamp(30px, 4.3vw, 50px);\\n      line-height: 1.02;\\n      font-weight: 800;\\n      color: #ffffff;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-hero p {\\n      max-width: 74ch;\\n      margin: 0;\\n      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.88);\\n      font-size: 16px;\\n      line-height: 1.75;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-overview {\\n      display: grid;\\n      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.8fr) repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));\\n      gap: 18px;\\n      margin-bottom: 24px;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-overview__card {\\n      padding: 22px 22px 20px;\\n      border-radius: 24px;\\n      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff 0%, #f8fbff 100%);\\n      border: 1px solid var(--fisica-doc-border);\\n      box-shadow: var(--fisica-doc-shadow-soft);\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-overview__card strong {\\n      display: block;\\n      color: var(--fisica-doc-primary-strong);\\n      font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 42px);\\n      line-height: 1;\\n      font-weight: 800;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-overview__card span {\\n      display: block;\\n      margin-top: 8px;\\n      color: var(--fisica-doc-text-soft);\\n      font-size: 14px;\\n      line-height: 1.6;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-overview__card--lead {\\n      background:\\n        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.98) 0%, rgba(237, 245, 255, 0.96) 100%);\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-overview__card--lead h2 {\\n      margin: 0 0 10px;\\n      color: var(--fisica-doc-primary-strong);\\n      font-size: clamp(22px, 2.6vw, 30px);\\n      line-height: 1.15;\\n      font-weight: 800;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-overview__card--lead p {\\n      margin: 0;\\n      color: var(--fisica-doc-text-soft);\\n      font-size: 15px;\\n      line-height: 1.7;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-toolbar {\\n      display: flex;\\n      flex-wrap: wrap;\\n      align-items: center;\\n      justify-content: space-between;\\n      gap: 16px;\\n      margin-bottom: 18px;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-search {\\n      display: flex;\\n      align-items: center;\\n      gap: 12px;\\n      min-width: min(100%, 460px);\\n      padding: 14px 18px;\\n      border-radius: 18px;\\n      background: #ffffff;\\n      border: 1px solid var(--fisica-doc-border);\\n      box-shadow: var(--fisica-doc-shadow-soft);\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-search span {\\n      color: var(--fisica-doc-primary);\\n      font-size: 16px;\\n      font-weight: 700;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-search input {\\n      flex: 1 1 auto;\\n      min-width: 0;\\n      border: 0;\\n      outline: none;\\n      background: transparent;\\n      color: var(--fisica-doc-primary-strong);\\n      font-size: 15px;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-search input::placeholder {\\n      color: #7b90a4;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-toolbar__info {\\n      color: var(--fisica-doc-text-soft);\\n      font-size: 14px;\\n      line-height: 1.6;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-tabs {\\n      display: flex;\\n      flex-wrap: wrap;\\n      gap: 12px;\\n      margin-bottom: 20px;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-tab {\\n      display: inline-flex;\\n      align-items: center;\\n      gap: 12px;\\n      appearance: none;\\n      border: 1px solid rgba(15, 76, 129, 0.16);\\n      background: #ffffff;\\n      color: var(--fisica-doc-primary);\\n      border-radius: 18px;\\n      padding: 14px 16px;\\n      font-size: 14px;\\n      line-height: 1.3;\\n      font-weight: 800;\\n      cursor: pointer;\\n      box-shadow: var(--fisica-doc-shadow-soft);\\n      transition: transform 180ms ease, box-shadow 180ms ease, border-color 180ms ease, background 180ms ease, color 180ms ease;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-tab:hover,\\n    .fisica-docentes-tab:focus-visible {\\n      transform: translateY(-2px);\\n      border-color: rgba(15, 76, 129, 0.34);\\n      outline: none;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-tab.is-active {\\n      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f4c81 0%, #1f6fb4 100%);\\n      color: #ffffff;\\n      border-color: #0f4c81;\\n      box-shadow: 0 20px 34px rgba(15, 76, 129, 0.22);\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-tab__label {\\n      text-align: left;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-tab__count {\\n      display: inline-flex;\\n      align-items: center;\\n      justify-content: center;\\n      min-width: 32px;\\n      padding: 4px 9px;\\n      border-radius: 999px;\\n      background: rgba(15, 76, 129, 0.08);\\n      font-size: 12px;\\n      line-height: 1;\\n      font-weight: 800;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-tab.is-active .fisica-docentes-tab__count {\\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-panel {\\n      display: none;\\n      border: 1px solid var(--fisica-doc-border);\\n      border-radius: 28px;\\n      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff 0%, #f7fbff 100%);\\n      box-shadow: var(--fisica-doc-shadow);\\n      overflow: hidden;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-panel.is-active {\\n      display: block;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-panel__head {\\n      display: flex;\\n      flex-wrap: wrap;\\n      align-items: flex-end;\\n      justify-content: space-between;\\n      gap: 18px;\\n      padding: 24px 24px 18px;\\n      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(15, 76, 129, 0.08);\\n      background:\\n        radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(89, 168, 255, 0.18), transparent 28%),\\n        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(15, 76, 129, 0.06), rgba(15, 76, 129, 0.02));\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-panel__eyebrow {\\n      display: inline-flex;\\n      margin-bottom: 10px;\\n      padding: 7px 12px;\\n      border-radius: 999px;\\n      background: rgba(15, 76, 129, 0.08);\\n      color: var(--fisica-doc-primary);\\n      font-size: 11px;\\n      font-weight: 800;\\n      letter-spacing: 0.12em;\\n      text-transform: uppercase;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-panel__head h2 {\\n      margin: 0;\\n      color: var(--fisica-doc-primary-strong);\\n      font-size: clamp(24px, 3vw, 34px);\\n      line-height: 1.1;\\n      font-weight: 800;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-panel__head p {\\n      margin: 10px 0 0;\\n      max-width: 70ch;\\n      color: var(--fisica-doc-text-soft);\\n      font-size: 14px;\\n      line-height: 1.7;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-panel__meta {\\n      min-width: 150px;\\n      padding: 14px 16px;\\n      border-radius: 18px;\\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);\\n      border: 1px solid rgba(15, 76, 129, 0.12);\\n      text-align: right;\\n    }\\n    .fisica-docentes-panel__meta strong {\\n      display: bloc