dopados; Nanofot&ocirc;nica e &oacute;ptica n&atilde;o linear; Sensores baseados em plasmons (LSPR); Dispositivos eletro-&oacute;pticos; Nanocomp&oacute;sitos funcionais;</p>\\n          <figure class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__media-card\\\" style=\\\"max-width: 520px;margin: 22px auto 28px 0;min-height: auto;padding: 14px 16px\\\">\\n            <img src=\\\"http://localhost/fisica/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Captura-de-tela-2026-06-09-155102.png\\\" alt=\\\"F&iacute;sica da Mat&eacute;ria Condensada Experimental - imagem 2\\\" style=\\\"width:auto;height:auto;max-width:100%;margin:0 auto\\\">\\n          </figure>\\n          <p class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__topics\\\">T&eacute;cnicas de abla&ccedil;&atilde;o laser e micro/nanofabrica&ccedil;&atilde;o; Prepara&ccedil;&atilde;o e caracteriza&ccedil;&atilde;o de novos materiais i-cal&oacute;ricos; Caracteriza&ccedil;&atilde;o de micropl&aacute;sticos; Aplica&ccedil;&otilde;es ambientais e detec&ccedil;&atilde;o de poluentes; Interface h&iacute;brida org&acirc;nica/inorg&acirc;nica para aplica&ccedil;&otilde;es na spintr&ocirc;nica; Processamento e an&aacute;lise de dados e imagens experimentais.</p>\\n        </section>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n    <aside class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__sidebar\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__sidebar-card\\\">\\n        <h3>Navega&ccedil;&atilde;o relacionada</h3>\\n        <p>A navega&ccedil;&atilde;o lateral facilita o retorno &agrave;s p&aacute;ginas principais e a conex&atilde;o com outros conte&uacute;dos de pesquisa.</p>\\n        <a class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__sidebar-link\\\" href=\\\"http://localhost/fisica/#programas\\\">Voltar para pesquisa</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </aside>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\"},\"elements\":[]}],\"isInner\":false}]'),(7614,1228,'_wp_attached_file','2026/06/ChatGPT-Image-15-de-jun.-de-2026-13_26_31.png'),(7615,1228,'_wp_attachment_metadata','a:6:{s:5:\"width\";i:1448;s:6:\"height\";i:1086;s:4:\"file\";s:53:\"2026/06/ChatGPT-Image-15-de-jun.-de-2026-13_26_31.png\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:1329061;s:5:\"sizes\";a:0:{}s:10:\"image_meta\";a:12:{s:8:\"aperture\";s:1:\"0\";s:6:\"credit\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"camera\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"created_timestamp\";s:1:\"0\";s:9:\"copyright\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"focal_length\";s:1:\"0\";s:3:\"iso\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"shutter_speed\";s:1:\"0\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"orientation\";s:1:\"0\";s:8:\"keywords\";a:0:{}}}'),(7616,1229,'_wp_page_template','default'),(7617,1229,'_elementor_edit_mode','builder'),(7618,1229,'_elementor_template_type','wp-page'),(7619,1229,'_elementor_version','3.32.1'),(7620,1229,'_elementor_data','[{\"id\":\"detail_mc_exp\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"flex_direction\":\"column\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"html_mc_exp\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"widgetType\":\"html\",\"settings\":{\"html\":\"<section class=\\\"fisica-detail-page\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__hero\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__hero-card\\\">\\n      <span class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__eyebrow\\\">Linha de Pesquisa</span>\\n      <h1 class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__title\\\">F&iacute;sica da Mat&eacute;ria Condensada Experimental</h1>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n  <div class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__wrap\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__content\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__panel\\\">\\n        <section class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__section\\\">\\n          <h2>F&iacute;sica da Mat&eacute;ria Condensada Experimental</h2>\\n          <p>Os professores do Instituto que atuam nesta &aacute;rea realizam pesquisas em s&iacute;ntese, caracteriza&ccedil;&atilde;o e aplica&ccedil;&otilde;es de materiais, com &ecirc;nfase no uso de t&eacute;cnicas experimentais e &oacute;pticas. A seguir, s&atilde;o destacados os principais temas de pesquisa vinculados a essa &aacute;rea de atua&ccedil;&atilde;o.</p>\\n          <p class=\\\"fisica-detail-page__topics\\\">Detec&ccedil;&atilde;o e 