nk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" aria-label=\"Abrir curr&iacute;culo Lattes de Wagner de Paula Carvalho\">Acessar</a></td></tr><tr class=\"fisica-docentes-row\" data-search=\"walter luiz alda junior f&iacute;sica experimental de altas energias 3024-a\"><td data-label=\"Docente\">Walter Luiz Alda Junior</td><td data-label=\"&Aacute;rea de pesquisa\">F&iacute;sica Experimental de Altas Energias</td><td data-label=\"Sala\">3024-A</td><td data-label=\"Lattes\"><a href=\"http://lattes.cnpq.br/5721137820988643\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" aria-label=\"Abrir curr&iacute;culo Lattes de Walter Luiz Alda Junior\">Acessar</a></td></tr>n          </tbody>n        </table>n      </div>nn      <div class=\"fisica-docentes-empty\" hidden>n        Nenhum docente encontrado para a busca nesta &aacute;rea.n      </div>n    </section>n  </div>nn  <script>n    (() => {n      const app = document.querySelector(\'[data-docentes-app]\');n      if (!app || app.dataset.ready === \'true\') {n        return;n      }n      app.dataset.ready = \'true\';nn      const tabs = Array.from(app.querySelectorAll(\'[data-docentes-tab]\'));n      const panels = Array.from(app.querySelectorAll(\'.fisica-docentes-panel\'));n      const search = app.querySelector(\'[data-docentes-search]\');n      const feedback = app.querySelector(\'[data-docentes-feedback]\');nn      const activate = (index) => {n        tabs.forEach((tab, tabIndex) => {n          const active = tabIndex === index;n          tab.classList.toggle(\'is-active\', active);n          tab.setAttribute(\'aria-selected\', active ? \'true\' : \'false\');n        });nn        panels.forEach((panel, panelIndex) => {n          const active = panelIndex === index;n          panel.classList.toggle(\'is-active\', active);n          panel.hidden = !active;n        });nn        filterRows();n      };nn      const filterRows = () => {n        const activePanel = app.querySelector(\'.fisica-docentes-panel.is-active\');n        if (!activePanel) {n          return;n        }nn        const term = (search?.value || \'\').trim().toLowerCase();n        const rows = Array.from(activePanel.querySelectorAll(\'.fisica-docentes-row\'));n        let visible = 0;nn        rows.forEach((row) => {n          const haystack = row.dataset.search || \'\';n          const match = term === \'\' || haystack.includes(term);n          row.hidden = !match;n          if (match) {n            visible += 1;n          }n        });nn        const empty = activePanel.querySelector(\'.fisica-docentes-empty\');n        if (empty) {n          empty.hidden = visible !== 0;n        }nn        if (feedback) {n          if (term === \'\') {n            feedback.textContent = \'Consulte a rela&ccedil;&atilde;o completa de docentes por &aacute;rea.\';n          } else {n            feedback.textContent = visible + \' docente(s) encontrado(s) na &aacute;rea selecionada.\';n          }n        }n      };nn      tabs.forEach((tab) => {n        tab.addEventListener(\'click\', () => activate(Number(tab.dataset.docentesTab || 0)));n      });nn      search?.addEventListener(\'input\', filterRows);n      activate(0);n    })();n  </script>n</section>n\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"html\"}],\"isInner\":false}]'),(7829,1249,'_elementor_page_assets','a:1:{s:7:\"scripts\";a:1:{i:0;s:18:\"elementor-frontend\";}}'),(7830,1249,'_elementor_css','a:6:{s:4:\"time\";i:1781790614;s:5:\"fonts\";a:0:{}s:5:\"icons\";a:0:{}s:20:\"dynamic_elements_ids\";a:0:{}s:6:\"status\";s:4:\"file\";i:0;s:0:\"\";}'),(7835,1250,'_wp_attached_file','2026/06/GEO_5476-2.jpg'),(7836,1250,'_wp_attachment_metadata','a:6:{s:5:\"width\";i:8256;s:6:\"height\";i:5504;s:4:\"file\";s:22:\"2026/06/GEO_5476-2.jpg\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:23672065;s:5:\"sizes\";a:0:{}s:10:\"image_meta\";a:12:{s:8:\"aperture\";s:3:\"6.3\";s:6:\"credit\";s:15:\"GEORGE MAGARAIA\";s:6:\"camera\";s:10:\"NIKON D850\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"created_timestamp\";s:10:\"1739471839\";s:9:\"copyright\";s:15